  "abstract": "Best capacity so far (768x2) with AdamW (wd=1e-4) and global gradient clipping (norm=1.0). Peak LR 1e-3, dropout 0.10. Tests if AdamW+clip, which improved 512x2, yields gains at larger width. Curvature \u03bb=1e-4.",
